   "at": "vo1.out+0.9"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo3",
   "role": "voice",
   "text": "Time is a reference. Make one layer longer, and everything cued after it [[moves]]moves.",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "at": "vo2.out+0.9"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo4",
   "role": "voice",
   "text": "The voice starts as a line of text, and its words are cues. The music [[dips]]dips under it, and each effect [[lands]]lands on its cue.",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "at": "vo3.out+1.4"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo5",
   "role": "voice",
   "text": "Before it renders, it checks every frame, and the [[mix]]mix, and names each [[problem]]problem with its fix.",
   "speaker": "af_heart",
   "at": "vo4.out+0.9"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo6",
   "role": "voice",
   "text": "Then it renders on the GPU, with the sound mixed in. [[write]]Write it. [[check]]Check it. [[render]]Render it.",
